{
	//MISC DEFINITIONS
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_hubby": "hubby",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_stepdaughter": "step-daughter",

	//MAIL TEXT (please use spacing to preserve centered visual layout of the mail when possible; I can help with testing if you'd like)
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Mail.PamYobaLetter": "Hey kid,^ ^ Ya know how we talked about Yoba before? Well, I've decided to make some changes in my life. I'm gonna head to the chapel on Sundays with some of the others. Try and figure some stuff out.^ ^ Means I won't be able t' drive the bus on Sundays anymore. Hope it won't cause ya too much trouble.^ ^  -Pam[#]Pam's Self-Improvement",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Mail.PamBusChangedLetter": "NOTICE^ ^Due to a lack of drivers, the Pelican Town bus will no longer run on Sundays.^ ^The bus will continue to run Monday through Saturday.^ ^      -Stardew Valley Transit Bureau[#]No Bus on Sundays",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Mail.PamGusMarriedLetter": "^                 PAM & GUS^ ^                    ~*~^ ^          ARE PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE^ ^                    ~*~^ ^           THEIR RECENT MARRIAGE!^ ^ ^ In lieu of gifts, the happy couple would like to thank you for your friendship and support, which brought them to this day. Please find a small token of their gratitude attached to this letter.^ ^ - Penny, on behalf of the bride and groom %item id (O)341 1 %%[#]Pam & Gus Get a Happy Ending",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Mail.ReplacePaleAleLetter": "Hey Kid,^ ^ My joints are so stiff after that storm, I can barely get outta bed. I could really use somethin' warm to loosen everything up.^ ^ Could ya bring over a bowl of steamy parsnip soup?^ ^      -Pam%item quest 103 %%[#]Pam's Request",

	//PAM YOBA DIALOGUE
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Sun.1": "The chapel's kinda peaceful. Makes me feel like maybe things'll get better after all.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Sun.2": "I asked Yoba to help me out. I sure hope the Almighty answers my prayer.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Mon": "You know, I'd eat healthier food if I could afford it.#$e#Hey, you probably have a lot of tasty grub growin' on your farm, hm?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Tue": "I won't be stayin' late at the saloon anymore.$0#$e#I've been workin' on myself lately.$0#$b#Turns out, sleep is pretty important when it comes to feelin' better.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Thu": "Hey. Penny's my baby girl. Be nice to her or leave her alone, got it?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Thu4": "I don't spend as much time at the saloon lately.#$b#When I do go, I try not t' drink too much.#$b#Sometimes I mess up, but at least I'm tryin', right?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.summer_Thu4": "I just can't quit showin' up at the saloon.#$b#Maybe I just like the place or somethin'?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Fri": "It's weird. I'm startin' to look forward to wakin' up in the morning.#$b#That's never happened before.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Fri2": "Now that I'm spendin' more time at home, I'm gonna have t' get some new hobbies to do in the evenin'.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.fall_Fri": "I've really cut back on the drink, and Gus is helpin' keep me accountable.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon6": "Hey, kid. How ya been?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Entry.1": "Hey, Gus! Just one for me!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Entry.2": "Hey, I'm back!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Entry.3": "I'll get some yams, Gus!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon.1": "Hey, kid, how ya doin'?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon.2": "You should try today's special. Really hits the spot!$h",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon.3": "Hey, kid. How's your farm? Grow anything interesting lately?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.1": "Hey, kiddo! How was your day?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.2": "I missed you, little baby-girl!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.3": "Penny! You home?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.4": "Hey! I'm home!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Tue": "'All things in moderation.' Penny said that.#$b#Read it in one of her books, I think.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Thu": "How much do ya think I've saved by stayin' in this week?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Fri": "I may be cuttin' back, but it's Friday night!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Sat": "%Pam is lost in thought. Her beer looks warm and untouched. Better let her be.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.fall_2": "It's Penny's birthday today.#$b#She's had some bad ones 'cause of me.$2#$b#I hope this one's better.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.summer_8": "I better stop by the saloon and wish Gus a happy birthday. You should, too.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.spring_18": "Today's my birthday. Not sure what I'm gonna do.#$b#Maybe I'll treat myself to dinner at the saloon.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.Resort_Bar": "It's a special occasion, kid... I'm ordering somethin' unique.$h",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.GreenRain_2.1": "I think these rains are a warning from Yoba, the Almighty. That's what I think.#$e#What I mean is, we can't get too cocky. Or else, instead of a green rain, maybe we'll have a blood-red rain... See what I mean?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_YobaDialogue.Pam.GreenRain_2.2": "It's times like this all that prayin' pays off.#$e#At least, I hope so.$2",

	//GUS MARRIAGE DIALOGUE
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Gus.Thu": "Clint and a few other regulars come into the saloon almost every night.#$e#I'd probably go out of business if they stopped coming.$h#$b#So make sure you don't drive them away!",
	//not sure if the upgrade lines are loading in-game; will check on this later; they're nice to have but not required and not blocking
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Gus.pamHouseUpgrade": "Hey. I heard what you did for Pam. That was really nice of you!$h#$b#It's truly helped her turn over a new leaf.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Gus.pamHouseUpgradeAnonymous": "Every time Pam comes home, she grins from ear to ear! She loves her house, and I wish I could thank whoever did that for her!#$b#They truly deserve the best!$h",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Gus.spring_18": "It's Pam's birthday today. Don't forget!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Gus.fall_2": "I hope Penny likes the present I got for her.#$b#I want birthdays to be something she can look forward to from now on.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Gus.summer_8": "Can you believe it? I've never taken a day off for my birthday.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Gus.married_Penny": "I wish you and Penny nothing but joy, happiness, and a wonderful future!$1#$b#And don't forget to visit when you get a chance.",
    
	//PAM MARRIAGE DIALOGUE
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Mon": "I never really miss my old routine. It wasn't that great anyway.$k#$e#It's not so bad helpin' out at the saloon at night.#$b#I get to spend time with Gus and still remember it in the morning!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Tue": "The best part about bein' married to Gus?#$b#I don't have to go home alone anymore.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.summer_Tue6": "I had hopes and dreams like you, once... But look at me now.$s#$b#Life doesn't always turn out like you expect.#$b#Sometimes it turns out even better!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.fall_Wed": "Gus is an amazin' cook. You should come by the saloon and try one of his specials.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Thu4": "Penny says she's proud of me for layin' off the drink.#$b#And ya know what? I'm proud of me, too!$h",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Thu4_inlaw_Penny": "How are you and Penny holdin' up out at the farm?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.summer_Thu4": "We're workin' on somethin' new for the saloon...#$b#MOCKTAILS!$1#$b#Gus's lettin' me design the flavors. Wanna be a taste tester?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.fall_Thu": "Penny means the world to me, so you best treat her kindly.#$b#She's still my little baby-girl!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.winter_Thu": "It's awful cold, ain't it? A visit to the saloon should warm you up. Heh heh.#$b#Why don't you swing by the saloon later for a taste o' the Oh-Be-Joyful?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Fri": "Each day used to be just the same as the last...$s#$b#Now I know what I was missin' out on.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Fri2": "I used to wish I had a hobby. Ya know, somethin' to do other than hangin' around at the saloon every night.#$e#Heh heh. Funny thing is, nothin's really changed.#$b#The only difference is I'm the one gettin' paid instead of the other way 'round.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.fall_Fri": "Every day feels special now that I'm married t' Gus.#$b#Just proof that things really can change for the better.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Entry.1": "Hey, Gus! Havin' a good day?/Hey, I'm back!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Entry.2": "Hey, I'm back!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.1": "Hey, kiddo! How ya been?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.2": "I missed you, little baby-girl!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.3": "Penny! You home?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.4": "Anybody home?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Trailer_Entry.5": "Hey! I'm home!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon.1": "Hey, kid, how ya doin'?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon.2": "You should try today's special. Taste-tested it myself!$h",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon.3": "Hey, kid. How's your farm? Grow anything interesting lately?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon.4": "I'll take your order when you're ready.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon.5": "Oi, Gus! Another order up!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon.6": "Hey, kid. What can I do ya for?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon6": "Hey, kid. I'd buy you a drink, but we gotta make a profit, heh.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Tue": "Hey, kid. Want some coffee? Maybe somethin' t' eat?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Wed": "Hey, look who's here! How's life on the farm?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Thu": "I'm at the saloon workin' the register every night.#$b#It's our family business now, so I wanna help out.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Fri": "Friday nights are when the saloon really comes t' life! Heh heh.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Sat": "%Pam is busy taking orders and serving customers. She seems happy.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.Saloon_Sun": "Hey, kid. Wanna try the special? Or how 'bout a coffee?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.spring_18": "Today's my birthday.#$b#And I can honestly say I have everthing I could ever want.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.fall_2": "It's Penny's birthday today.#$b#She's had some bad ones 'cause of me.$2#$b#I hope this one's better.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Pam.summer_8": "If ya have time, stop by the saloon and wish Gus a happy birthday.",

	//PENNY PAM-GUS MARRIAGE DIALOG
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.Mon8": "I'm ready to move out now that I don't have to worry about Mom all the time.#$b#She's happy with her own life now and I can't stay here forever... you know?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.fall_Thu6": "Mom's taking better care of herself.#$b#I'm so proud of her!$h",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.Tue4": "Maybe now that my mother has her bus driving job back and she and Gus have the saloon...#$b#I can start saving more money for myself. Things are looking a little brighter.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.Fri4": "Can you believe it? Gus even cooks and helps out with the dishes at home. He's a really great guy!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.fall_Fri6": "When I was a little girl, my father abandoned us because he said he felt 'trapped'. We haven't seen him since.$2#$b#Now that Mom and Gus are married, it's like something has been... healed? Our family feels whole again.$1#$b#Anyway... How's the farming life going?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.Sun4": "Gus has been great about helping keep our place clean.$1#$b#Mom even tries to do what she can. Can you believe it?$1#$b#It's so much easier when everyone helps out.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.spring_18": "I get a little anxious this time of year.#$b#I know Mom's doing better now, but her birthday used to mean bottomless pints at the saloon and a lot of yelling.$3#$b#I'm still getting used it.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.fall_2": "It's my birthday today, but I'm not sure how I feel about it.#$b#I try to remind myself that things are better now.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.summer_8.1": "I'm not quite sure what to give Gus for his birthday.#$b#Maybe a book about the history of soup...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.summer_8.2": "I'm not quite sure what to give Gus for his birthday.#$b#Maybe a book about the history of pomegranates...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.summer_8.3": "I'm not quite sure what to give Gus for his birthday.#$b#Maybe a book about the history of coffee...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.summer_8.4": "I'm not quite sure what to give Gus for his birthday.#$b#Maybe a book about the history of melons...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.summer_8.5": "I'm not quite sure what to give Gus for his birthday.#$b#Maybe a book about the history of red cabbage...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_MarriageDialogue.Penny.SundayChurch": "Mom and Gus look so happy walking to the chapel together every Sunday.$1#$b#",

	//PAM'S PALE ALE QUEST UPDATE TO PARSNIP SOUP

	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_pam.replacepalealeletter.title": "Pam Needs Soup",
  	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_pam.replacepalealeletter.description": "Pam is hankerin' for a hearty, steamy bowl of parsnip soup to warm her aching, stiff joints. You can make it yourself if you have parsnips, milk, vinegar, and some way to cook it, of course.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_pam.replacepalealeletter.objective": "Bring Pam a bowl of parsnip soup.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_pam.replacepalealeletter.reaction": "Gimme that. *slurp*... Ahh, that's the stuff.#$b#It's real warm 'n cozy. My joints 're already startin' to feel better.#$b#Thanks, kid. This means a lot to me. I knew I could count on you.$h",

	//CONVERSATION TOPICS

	//Pam
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus01": "Gus is a great listener. He always knows what t' say.#$b#Talk to him if you need advice.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus02": "...urghh... my head...$4#$b#...must've been a fun night...$4#$b#...not that I can remember it...$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus05": "Dontcha worry about my tab anymore. Me and Gus, we got an agreement.#$b#I'm helpin' out around the saloon.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus061": "*mumble* Maybe Gus is right. But what would Penny think...$2#$b#Huh? Oh hey, @. I was just talkin' to myself.#$b#How're things on the farm?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus062": "*mumble* Maybe Gus is right. It's awful lonely without Penny around.$2#$b#Huh? Oh hey, @. I was just talkin' to myself.$0#$b#How're things on the farm? You better be treatin' my baby girl right!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus07": "Gus is the best chef in town and everybody knows it.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus08": "%Pam mumbles to herself... 'Why'd he do that? After all these years...'#$b#%She's lost in thought right now. Better check back later.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus101": "Marry... Gus...?$2#$b#%Pam looks a bit distracted and doesn't seem to notice you.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus102a": "I'm not used to gettin' my hopes up over anything good comin' my way.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus102b": "I'm not used to gettin' my hopes up over anything good comin' my way.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus103a": "I'm so darn happy I could cry!#$b#But I'm not gonna. You've seen me cry way too many times already.$1#$b#I wonder how long it'll take before I mess things up again?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Pam.PamGus103b": "I'm so darn happy I could cry!#$b#But I'm not gonna. You've seen me cry way too many times already.$1#$b#I wonder how long it'll take before I mess things up again?$2",

	//Gus
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus01": "Do you think Pam's ok? Sometimes I wonder.$2#$b#But it's not for me to judge, of course.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus02": "Sometimes Pam needs a little help getting home. It's not far and I don't really mind.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus05": "Pam helped me organize the storage room.#$b#Now I won't spend hours searching for my spare cork screw.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus061": "Do you believe in second chances, @?#$b#I think everyone deserves to be happy.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus062": "Do you believe in second chances, @?#$b#I think everyone deserves to be happy. Like you and Penny.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus07": "You have to try my new and improved glazed yams next time they're on the menu.#$b#Pam, our own glazed yams connoisseur, even gave them her seal of approval.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus08": "Sometimes it's worth taking a chance on the things you really want in life.#$b#Even if they could end in failure, you have to try. Otherwise, you'll always wonder.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus101": "She...needs to think about it...$2#$b#%Gus looks a bit distracted and doesn't seem to notice you.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus102a": "How long do you think it takes to make a big, life-changing decision?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus102b": "When you asked Penny to marry you, were you sure she would say yes?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus103a": "I still can't believe it! I must be the happiest person in Pelican Town.$1#$b#With Pam and Penny, it feels like I have a real family. It's nice to come home to people who care about you.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Gus.PamGus103b": "I still can't believe it! I must be the happiest person in Pelican Town.$1#$b#With Pam and Penny, it feels like I have a real family.#$b#And of course, I'm glad you're part of it, too, @.$1",

	//Penny
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Penny.PamGus02": "Gus often walks Mom home from the saloon at night.$1#$b#It's really kind of him, and I'm glad someone's looking out for her.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Penny.PamGus08": "Mom has been in a great mood lately!$1#$b#I wonder if something good happened. Do you know anything, @?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Penny.PamGus103a": "Did you hear the good news? Mom and Gus have gotten married!$1#$b#It will be nice to have Gus around the house. Maybe he'll even cook for us.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Penny.PamGus103b": "Did you hear the good news? Mom and Gus have gotten married!$1#$b#I'm so glad she has someone there for her now that I'm living on the farm.",
    
	//Emily
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Emily.PamGus103a": "It's so nice of Pam to come help out at the saloon.#$b#Maybe I can visit Sandy on my nights off.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Emily.PamGus103b": "It's so nice of Pam to come help out at the saloon.#$b#Maybe I can visit Sandy on my nights off.",

	//Lewis
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Lewis.PamGus103a": "Just between you and me, I knew they would figure it out eventually.$1#$b#In any case, it's always a good day when a new couple is added to the town registry.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_ConversationTopics.Lewis.PamGus103b": "Just between you and me, I knew they would figure it out eventually.$1#$b#In any case, it's always a good day when a new couple is added to the town registry.$1",

	//EVENTS DIALOG

	//ONE HEART
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.0": "Oi, Gus! Gimme another pint of your strongest!$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.1": "Here you are, Pam.", //GUS speaks in vanilla, EMILY speaks in DSV with Turkish Gus option
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.2": "Just add it to my tab, Gus!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.3": "You know, Gus...$1#$b#Yer good at listenin' and I'm gooood 'n' drunk.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.4": "Really? I'm willing to listen now, if you want.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.5": "Okay... well...$2#$b#Years ago, I wanted to be a pilot.$2#$b#Loved bein' up in the clouds, away from it all.$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.6": "*hic* Now the only time I get off the ground is when I sleep on the couch.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.7": "You could always try again.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.8": "What's the point?$4#$b#I'm too old and tired... and broke... to go through the hassle.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.9": "I'm a complete and total failure.$2#$b#Failed flight school.$2#$b#Failed relationship.$2#$b#Failed parent.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.10": "Pam...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.11": "(Crap...)$2#$b#Um...$2#$b#HA!$1#$b#Whatever! Doesn't even matter.$1#$b#There's no sense dwellin' on the past!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.12": "I guess not.#$b#But maybe the future isn't as bad as you think?$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.13": "I dunno about that.$4#$b#But it'll look a whole lot better after another drink.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.14": "What are you waiting for?#$b#Gimme another pint of your strongest!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.15": "Oi, Emily! Gimme another pint of your strongest!$4",  //DSV Turkish Gus option
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.16": "Just add it to my tab!",  //DSV Turkish Gus option
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.17": "What are you waiting for?#$b#Emily! Gimme another pint of your strongest!", //DSV Turkish Gus option
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.OneHeart.18": "Coming right up!", //EMILY, DSV Turkish Gus option

	//TWO HEART A & B
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.0": "Gimme... another... *mumble*$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.1": "Pam, the saloon's closed now. Will you be okay?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.2": "*mumble* ...wut're we doin' ...outside?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.3": "Uh, Pam, you live in the other direction.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.4": "*mumble* ...oh...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.5": "*sigh* Let's get you home.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.6": "I told ya... 'm fine...$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.7": "...$2#$b#I'm so sorry, Gus.$2#$b#Thank you for bringing Mom home safely.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.8": "It's no problem at all.#$b#It's dark out here and the river's so close. Just wanted to make sure she made it.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.9": "She's lucky you're looking out for her.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.10": "Well then, Pam, I think it's time to go with Penny now.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.11": "WHAT!?$3#$b#BUT I AIN'T DONE YET!$3#$b#I'm still standin'!$3#$b#I could drink AT LEAST six more pints before callin' it quits!$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.12": "What's all that ruckus!? It's the middle of the night!$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.13": "Sorry, Mr. Mullner!$3#$b#We'll keep it down.$3#$b#Have a good evening.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.14": "Hmph!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.15": "He's right. It's getting late.$2#$b#Let's go, Mom.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.16": "Here, Penny. I'll help you get her inside.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.17": "Thanks.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.18": "I'm so sorry, Gus.$2#$b#Thanks for calling me...$2#$b#...and for bringing Mom home safely.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TwoHeart.19": "He's right. It's getting late.$2#$b#And I need to head back to the farm.$2#$b#Let's go, Mom.",

	//FIVE HEART
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.0": "Are you sure you want to help me organize this stuff, Pam?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.1": "I could have Emily come in early and-",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.2": "And nothin'! Lemme help ya out!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.3": "Okay! I really appreciate you volunteering.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.4": "I mean, I'm not exactly a volunteer...#$b#Figured I could keep my tab paid off by doin' a little work and feelin' useful at the same time.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.5": "Ah, I see! That sounds like a fair trade.$3#$b#Help me organize the storeroom, and I'll reduce your tab by the time worked.$3#$b#Deal?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.6": "Deal!$1#$b#I can't promise too much, though.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.7": "My legs can get pretty stiff when the weather changes.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.8": "I'm sure we can work it out.$1#$b#But... you know...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.9": "Pam, your worth as a person isn't based on whether you're useful or not.$3#$b#You know that, right?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.10": "I, uh, didn't come here for a pep talk, Gus.$4#$b#I came here to work!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.11": "Okay, okay!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.12": "Now where should we start?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.FiveHeart.13": "Let's start over there!$1",

	//SIX HEART A & B
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.0": "*sigh* Evenin', Gus.$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.1": "Hello, Pam. How are you tonight?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.2": "How's Penny doing?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.3": "Y'know, that Penny... she's sharp.$4#$b#Shoulda gone to college and learned to be a real teacher. Make a future for herself.$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.4": "But I was too broke to pay for it.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.5": "And one of these days...$4#$b#*hic*$4#$b#She's gonna get married and move out.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.6": "It's gonna be real quiet at home when she does.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.7": "...um...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.8": "I'll... have another pint, Gus...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.9": "Here you are, Pam.", //GUS in vanilla, EMILY with DSV Turkish Gus option
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.10": "Just what I needed!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.11": "What about you, Pam?$3#$b#Have you thought about trying again?$3#$b#With someone else?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.12": "What!? Are you kidding?$4#$b#After everything I went through with Penny's dad...$4#$b#...and everything I put him through.$2#$b#You think I'd wanna do it all over again?$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.13": "...maybe...$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.14": "But I ain't gonna be able to fix the real problem: me.$4#$b#So it's not worth my time. Or anybody else's.$2#$b#Besides, who'd wanna marry me anyway. My life's a mess.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.15": "I don't know about that.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.16": "They say there's someone out there for everyone.$3#$b#Maybe even someone you already know.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.17": "Ha!$1#$b#You think there's someone just waiting for me to get my head right and notice 'em?$1#$b#Yeah right! Next you'll be tellin' me I won the Zuzu City lotto or somethin'.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.18": "*sigh* Yeah, I guess so.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.19": "Next one's on the house, Pam.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.20": "Aw, you're the best, Gus!",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.21": "And now...$4#$b#*hic*$4#$b#she's married and moved out.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.22": "It's gotten real quiet at home without her around.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SixHeart.23": "I'll... have another pint, Emily...$2", //DSV Turkish Gus option

	//SEVEN HEART
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.0": "Gee, Gus. This is so nice.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.1": "I haven't had a dinner that wasn't microwaved in...#$b#...well, a really long time.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.2": "I wanted to do something special.#$b#Plus, you get to try out my NEW and IMPROVED glazed yams!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.3": "I didn't think you could top the original, but they smell delicious!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.4": "I knew you'd love them!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.5": "...ahem... but... well...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.6": "Pam...$3#$b#...there's actually something else I wanted to talk to you about.$3#$b#Us.$2#$b#I mean, we've been friends for a long time now... and...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.7": "Aw, Gus, ya big softy!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.8": "Uh, well... you see... I mean...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.9": "Gus, can I tell ya something?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.10": "Anything. O-of course, Pam.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.11": "Uh, maybe, I feel like life has just passed me by, ya know?$2#$b#Every day is the same old routine.$2#$b#I'm not too sure where to go from here.$2#$b#So I end up at the saloon like always.$2#$b#It's kinda, well... lonely, I guess.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.12": "Pam, me and the saloon...$2#$b#We'll always be here for you.$3#$b#You don't have to be lonely.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.13": "And you don't have to be alone.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.14": "Gus...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.15": "Pam... I, uh...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.16": "U-uh, hey! The yams are gettin' cold!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.17": "Oh, right! Better dig in, then.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.SevenHeart.18": "(Will she ever notice...?)$2",

	//EIGHT HEART
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.EightHeart.0": "Y'know, ya didn't have to walk me home. It's not that far and I feel fine.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.EightHeart.1": "Maybe I just like your company?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.EightHeart.2": "Ha! I find that hard to believe.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.EightHeart.3": "Well, Pam...$2#$b#Would you believe this...?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.EightHeart.4": "Oh.$2#$b#(Wow...!)$2#$b#Uh.#$b#Then, uh...#$b#G'night, Gus.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.EightHeart.5": "Good night, Pam.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.EightHeart.6": "I can't believe I finally did it!$1",

	//TEN HEART #1
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.0": "Hey, Gus. Ya wanted to talk to me?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.1": "Yes, Pam. Please, uh, please come in.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.2": "Are you ok? You look kinda sick.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.3": "I'm just a little nervous.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.4": "Nervous? Is this about my tab again? I thought we already-$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.5": "No, no, it's not about your tab.$1#$b#Look, Pam, how do I say this?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.6": "Is somethin' wrong? Out with it, mister.$2#$b#Don't make me wait for bad news!$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.7": "No, it's nothing like that.#$b#How do I put this?$2#$b#Ahem...$3#$b#I've come to really care about you over the years, Pam.$3#$b#And I think you care about me, too.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.8": "Gus...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.9": "Pam, let me take away your loneliness.$2#$b#Let me show you that...#$b#That you're not alone.$2#$b#That there's still a future for you.$2#$b#Here. With me.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.10": "What're you tryin' to say?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.11": "I have a mermaid pendant, and I'd like to give it to you.#$b#If you're willing to try again, Pam, I'd be honored if you would try again with me.$2#$b#As my wife. Will you marry me?$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.12": "...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.13": "I think we could be happy together.#$b#If you'll have me.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.14": "Uh...$2#$b#I'm... not sure...$2#$b#I'm gonna have to think about this.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.15": "Oh...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.16": "That ain't a no!$2#$b#It's just... you know how my previous relationship went.$2#$b#I ruined things with Penny's dad and, well, I'm not sure I wanna ruin another one.$2#$b#Especially not with you, Gus.$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.17": "I understand.$2#$b#Take some time to think it over.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.18": "I'll wait as long as you need me to.$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.19": "You better!$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart1.20": "I'll see you later, Gus.",

	//TEN HEART #2 A & B
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.0": "...why'd he have t' ask me that...$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.1": "...he'll change his mind...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.2": "...someone younger... prettier... ugh...$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.3": "...useless old drunk with no future...$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.4": "Mom, are you alright? Can I come in?$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.5": "I'm fine. Just thinking.$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.6": "Mom, I'm worried about you.#$b#We were supposed to meet this morning, but you never showed up.$2#$b#Is there anything I can do to help?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.7": "No, I just... it's... ugh. Fine, but...$4#$b#It's Gus.$4#$b#Penny... he asked me t' marry him.$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.8": "He finally did it?$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.9": "What d'you mean 'finally'?$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.10": "Um, well, you see, Mom...$3#$b#He asked me if I would be alright with it. He came by the farm.#$b#I told him it would be fine, of course, but I guess he had to build up his courage.#$b#What a sweet man!$1#$b#Did you give him an answer yet?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.11": "No.$4#$b#I told him I had to think about it.$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.12": "Oh, really?$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.13": "To be honest, I didn't know how you'd feel about yer old mom gettin' hitched.$2#$b#But if you're fine with it, then I guess...$2#$b#I don't have any reason to turn him down.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.14": "Mom, do you want to marry Gus?$3#$b#Do you love him?$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.15": "Um...$2#$b#Yeah.#$b#I think I do.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.16": "Oh, Mom, I'm so happy for you!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.17": "Well, don't go congratulatin' me yet!#$b#Maybe he changed his mind while he was waiting.$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.18": "I doubt it!$1#$b#He couldn't stop smiling when we talked.$1#$b#I just know he's going to be thrilled when you tell him.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.19": "Here's hoping, kiddo.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.20": "Mom, I'm worried about you. You've been in here all morning.$2#$b#Is there anything I can do to help?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.21": "To be honest, I was worried about leavin' you here all alone.$2#$b#And I didn't know how you'd feel about yer old mom gettin' hitched.$2#$b#But if you're fine with it, then I guess...$2#$b#I don't have any reason to turn him down.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart2.22": "Um, well, you see, Mom...$3#$b#He asked me if I would be alright with it. A while ago.#$b#I told him it would be fine, of course, but I guess he had to build up his courage.#$b#What a sweet man!$1#$b#Did you give him an answer yet?",

	//TEN HEART #3 A & B
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.0": "Oh! Hi there, Pam.#$b#You know we're not open yet, right?",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.1": "I know, I just need to talk for a sec.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.2": "Oh. Is everything alright?$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.3": "Gus. Look. I'm not very good at this kinda thing.$2#$b#But if ya still want to...$2#$b#I'd like to take you up on, uh, on yer offer?$2",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.4": "My offer?$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.5": "Us gettin' hitched!$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.6": "Really!? You mean it?$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.7": "I mean it. If you'll have me.$1#$b#And if you're sure you know what yer gettin' yourself into.",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.8": "I'm sure, Pam!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.9": "We could even go over to Mayor Lewis's house now and update the registry.$1#$b#Unless you wanted a big ceremony. That would take more planning, but we could-$3",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.10": "No. I've done the dress, the party, the whole shebang.#$b#In the end, it didn't mean squat.$4#$b#Let's just find Lewis and get hitched!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.11": "MAYOR LEWIS!!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.12": "AHHHHHH!#$b#What are we yelling about!?$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.13": "Marry us!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.14": "What!?$4",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.15": "She means...$1#$b#Mayor Lewis, we'd like to get married.$1#$b#Would you add us to the registry to make it official?$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.16": "Yeah, that's what I said!$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.17": "Well, it's about time.$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.18": "You don't mean...",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.19": "It was that obvious, huh?$1",
	"teainthesunroom.PamGusHappyEnding_Events.TenHeart3.20": "I pride myself on knowing what goes on in Pelican Town.$1#$b#Of course I'll add you to the registry.$1",
